u.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/ES_USQO570425A_2114001460_0_20260817T184938961Z_123_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-648598f6b5-j5xsn.jpeg"},{"s":1795303860,"e":1795305480,"t":"¡Guerreros del Agua!","d":"Earth Eleven vence a Silica y se encuentra con la princesa Catora, la chica de los sueños de Arion.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/ES_USQO570425A_2114001460_0_20260817T184938961Z_123_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-648598f6b5-j5xsn.jpeg"},{"s":1795305480,"e":1795307100,"t":"La Oscuridad de Falco","d":"El equipo descubre que Naiadi lee el aethyr de sus rivales y no sabe cómo superar ese poder.","i":"https://tvpnlogopeu.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/ES_USQO570425A_2114001460_0_20260817T184938961Z_123_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-648598f6b5-j5xsn.jpeg"}]